        "start": 0,
        "text": "SYNTHETIC HACKATHON SAMPLE — NOT COMPANY POLICY\nSynthetic Travel and Expense Policy — Corrected Control\n\nEligible categories\nMeal, hotel, transport, airfare, and incidental expenses are eligible for reimbursement when incurred for business travel.\n\nCategory caps\nMeal claims have a per-claim cap of SGD 100.\nMeal claims have a daily category cap of SGD 100.\nHotel claims have a per-claim cap of SGD 250.\nTransport claims have a per-claim cap of SGD 200.\n\nReceipts\nReceipts are not required for claims below SGD 50.\nReceipts are required for claims at or above SGD 50.\n\nApprovals\nApproval is normally not required for a claim.\nHotel claims below SGD 250 require no approval, regardless of destination.\nInternational hotel claims require manager approval and override both the normal no-approval rule and the hotel-specific no-approval rule.\nAirfare booked fewer than 14 days before travel requires manager approval.\n\nUnsupported language\nReasonable incidental expenses may be reimbursed.\n"
      }
    ],
